D[14761]={"^|cffffffffRequires Stalker Form|r\nBite an enemy for (.-) Plague Damage, refreshing 1 |cffffffffLeg Strike|r charge%. \n\nThis spell always critically strikes%.\n\nIf the target is affected by 2 stacks of |cffffffffLethal Toxin|r, consume them to deal additional Nature Damage%.\n\nIf the target is affected by |cffffffffLeech Poison|r, afflict them with |cffffffffDread Poison|r for (.-)%.%s*$","|cffffffffRequer Forma de Espreitador|r\nMorde um inimigo, causando {{1}} de dano de Peste, restaurando 1 carga de |cffffffffGolpe de Perna|r.\n\nEste feitiço sempre causa acerto crítico.\n\nSe o alvo estiver afetado por 2 acúmulos de |cffffffffToxina Letal|r, consome-os para causar dano de Natureza adicional.\n\nSe o alvo estiver afetado por |cffffffffVeneno Parasita|r, o aflige com |cffffffffVeneno Terrível|r durante {{2}}."}
