D[64778]={"^%$%?a800841%[|cffffffff%]%[|cffff3232%]Requires Stalker Form|r\nBite an enemy for (.-) Plague Damage%$%?s706959%[, refreshing 1 |cffffffffLeg Strike|r charge%]%[%]%. \n\nThis spell always critically strikes and generates (.-) rage%.%$%?s706958%[\n\nIf the target is affected by 2 stacks of |cffffffffLethal Toxin|r, consume them to deal additional (.-) Nature Damage%.%]%[%]%$%?s705951%[\n\nIf the target is affected by |cffffffffLeech Poison|r, afflict them with |cffffffffDread Poison|r for (.-)%.%]%[%]%s*$","$?a800841[|cffffffff][|cffff3232]Requer Forma de Espreitador|r\nMorde um inimigo, causando {{1}} de dano de Peste$?s706959[, restaurando 1 carga de |cffffffffGolpe de Perna|r][].\n\nEste feitiço sempre causa acerto crítico e gera {{2}} de Raiva.$?s706958[\n\nSe o alvo estiver sob 2 acúmulos de |cffffffffToxina Letal|r, consome-os para causar {{3}} de dano de Natureza adicional.][]$?s705951[\n\nSe o alvo estiver afetado por |cffffffffVeneno Parasita|r, aflige-o com |cffffffffVeneno Terrível|r durante {{4}}.][]"}
